        <tr id="comment-body-417032"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>针对 2月22号 至 3月31号 期间的621版本，在升级之前需要安装下面的对接包：</p>

<p><span class="nobr"><a href="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/304488" title="solution-fix_cg_rdma_621rc_runc-v1-arm.es attached to EAS-124820" data-attachment-type="file" data-attachment-name="solution-fix_cg_rdma_621rc_runc-v1-arm.es" data-media-services-type="file" data-media-services-id="66135ee6-a3fd-40bd-850b-674a0a6b99df" rel="noreferrer">solution-fix_cg_rdma_621rc_runc-v1-arm.es<sup><img class="rendericon" src="/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span><br/>
<span class="nobr"><a href="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/304487" title="solution-fix_cg_rdma_621rc_runc-v1-x86.es attached to EAS-124820" data-attachment-type="file" data-attachment-name="solution-fix_cg_rdma_621rc_runc-v1-x86.es" data-media-services-type="file" data-media-services-id="7581f7e5-3939-452c-b269-e1a46817960b" rel="noreferrer">solution-fix_cg_rdma_621rc_runc-v1-x86.es<sup><img class="rendericon" src="/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span></p>

